Update `~/.config/gemini-cli/config.json` (or `settings.json`) to point to the central hub URL:

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "colima-hub": {
      "httpUrl": "http://localhost:8811/mcp"
    }
  }
}

Antigravity typically requires a Stdio bridge to connect to SSE hubs. In 'View raw config', use `mcp-remote`:

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "central-hub": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "mcp-remote", "http://localhost:8811/sse"],
      "env": {}
    }
  }
}
